  "identifier": "ehrshot",
  "name": "EHRSHOT",
  "description": "Few-shot evaluation benchmark for EHR foundation models from the Shah Lab at Stanford Medicine. Contains 6,739 de-identified longitudinal patient records from Stanford Health Care (41.7M structured coded events across 921K visits), 15 clinical prediction tasks spanning operational outcomes, lab value anticipation, new diagnosis assignment, and chest X-ray findings. Includes a pretrained 141M-parameter clinical foundation model (CLMBR-T-base) and reproducible evaluation code. Structured EHR only — no clinical notes or images. Dataset access requires a Stanford AIMI data use agreement; code is Apache 2.0. NeurIPS 2023 Datasets and Benchmarks Spotlight.",
  "url": "https://som-shahlab.github.io/ehrshot-website/",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/som-shahlab/ehrshot-benchmark",
  "relatedLink": [
    "https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.02028"
  ],
